# Independent review of graph/3.13.kg (earlier restarts and the greenfield carrier). One review node per claim, each naming the digest it read. Git facts were read with read-only git commands in the old body's repository; the carrier was read whole and compiled again in a scratch directory; the old runtime was not run.

n: 9.5.18
kind: hub
name: review-of-earlier-restarts-and-carrier
is: All 39 claims of 3.13.kg (20 observations, 19 findings; none relayed) were read against their sources: 30 confirmed, 9 amended (3.13.1.3, 3.13.1.8, 3.13.1.9, 3.13.2.8, 3.13.2.11, 3.13.3.2, 3.13.9.1, 3.13.9.2, 3.13.9.3), none disputed, none left unreviewed. The carrier's witness and the study's limits probe were compiled and run again: the 31 checks reproduce, the 3,947-offer limit does not (4,019 to 4,034 in three runs).
at: 2026-11-24

